#: ../../source/docs/common-rtf.rst:7 26edcd16339a435680110e24b87fde3a
#: 41aa53d08e8041908970a5556cd7d016 49a97522be7b407b8459206205e751dd
#: 625194942e404144aaeacf26de91c7ba 8cf580e4243240c19a555f861ea477d1
